      <div type="layout" source="#source-7699-7986" style="padding-inline-end: 11em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-7732-7984"><seg source="#source-7732-7747">江戸　　　</seg><hi rend="font-size large(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=large;level=1" source="#source-7747-7828" corresp="#source-7747-7780 #source-7795-7828"><seg source="#source-7780-7795">京山人百樹</seg></hi><seg source="#source-7828-7831">并</seg><hi rend="font-size large(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=large;level=1" source="#source-7831-7900" corresp="#source-7831-7864 #source-7867-7900"><seg source="#source-7864-7867">書</seg></hi><seg source="#source-7900-7906">　　</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-7906-7984"><graphic url="fig59113_01.png" width="55px" height="89px"/><figDesc>京山人百樹押印の図</figDesc></figure></p>
